    ["5200145   普通·神弃之地-王庭   副本"] = "5200145 Normal Forsaken Land - King's Court Instance",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>获取秘偶</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n“愚者”先生赐予的封印物<Assistant_Property1>乌托邦剧院</>，可以帮助非凡者获取并操控秘偶。\n1、通过<Assistant_System>菜单-秘偶-获取秘偶</>可以进入<Assistant_Property1>乌托邦剧院</>，抽选<Assistant_Property2>秘偶</>，解锁对应秘偶技能。\n2、乌托邦剧院戏台每次<Assistant_Property1>刷新</>会上架<Assistant_Red>3个</>秘偶，可供抽选。若抽选后戏台上只剩<Assistant_Red>紫色</>品质秘偶，戏台会自动刷新。\n序幕抽选：消耗<Assistant_Property1>金纺线</>*3，从台上3个秘偶中随机获得1个。\n中幕抽选：消耗<Assistant_Property1>金纺线</>*6，从台上剩余2个秘偶中随机获得1个。\n落幕抽选：消耗<Assistant_Property1>金纺线</>*12，必定获得台上剩余的1个秘偶。\n3、序幕抽选后，也可以主动<Assistant_Property1>放弃</>剩余秘偶，进行刷新。\n4、进行<Assistant_Property1>秘偶许愿</>，选择特定的秘偶，可以提升该秘偶出现的概率。\n5、重复获取的秘偶会转化为秘偶碎片，可用来进行<Assistant_Property1>秘偶培养</>，提升角色属性和增强秘偶技能。\n6、秘偶培养达到上限后，溢出的<Assistant_Property1>秘偶碎片</>会转化为<Assistant_Property1>人偶发条</>，可以到<Assistant_Property1>秘偶商店</>兑换为其他道具。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[秘偶培养]|537}，{SendAnswer:[人偶发条]|543}，{SendAnswer:[秘偶商店]|545}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Obtain Marionette</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions: </>\nThe Sealed Artifact <Assistant_Property1>Utopia Theater</> bestowed by Mr. Fool can help Beyonders obtain and control marionettes.\n1. You can enter the <Assistant_System>Utopia Theater</> via <Assistant_Property1>Menu - Marionette - Obtain Marionette</> to draw <Assistant_Property2>marionettes</> and unlock corresponding Marionette Skills.\n2. The Utopia Theater stage will <Assistant_Property1>refresh</> and list <Assistant_Red>3</> marionettes available for selection each time. If only <Assistant_Red>Purple</> quality marionettes remain on the stage after drawing, the stage will automatically refresh.\nPrologue Draw: Consumes <Assistant_Property1>Gold Thread</>*3 to randomly obtain 1 of the 3 marionettes on stage.\nInterlude Draw: Consumes <Assistant_Property1>Gold Thread</>*6 to randomly obtain 1 of the 2 remaining marionettes on stage.\nCurtain Call Draw: Consumes <Assistant_Property1>Gold Thread</>*12 to guarantee obtaining the 1 remaining marionette on stage.\n3. After the Prologue Draw, you can also choose to <Assistant_Property1>give up</> on the remaining marionettes and refresh.\n4. Perform <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Wish</> and select a specific marionette to increase the probability of that marionette appearing.\n5. Duplicate marionettes obtained will be converted into Marionette Shards, which can be used for <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Cultivation</> to increase character attributes and enhance Marionette Skills.\n6. After Marionette Cultivation reaches the limit, excess <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Shards</> will be converted into <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Clockwork</>, which can be exchanged for other items in the <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Shop</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Marionette Cultivation]|537}, {SendAnswer:[Marionette Clockwork]|543}, {SendAnswer:[Marionette Shop]|545}",
    ["<Highlight>尽快击破所有分身，</>中止小丑的研究。"] = "<Highlight>Destroy all projections as soon as possible</> to stop the Clown's research.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>亚麻棉纺・麦穗刺绣・田园便服\n于莫尔斯小镇的金色麦浪中，拾取一段曾经的温柔时光。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Linen Cotton · Wheat Ear Embroidery · Pastoral Casual Wear \n In the golden wheat waves of the small town of Morse, pick up a piece of gentle time from the past.",
    ["<Highlight>自由发言模式：</>所有玩家均可开麦发言。\n<Highlight>房主设置发言权限：</>此模式下玩家可以点击开麦按钮主动发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可获得发言权限。房主也可在玩家列表中手动调整玩家的发言权限。\n<Highlight>房主设置发言顺序：</>此模式下最多设置8个麦序座位。默认为顺序发言，仅房主和1号麦玩家可开麦，1号麦玩家发言完毕需自行点击下麦，将麦序传给2号麦玩家。"] = "<Highlight> Free Speech Mode: </> All players can unmute and speak. \n<Highlight> Host-Controlled Speech Permission: </> In this mode, players can click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, they gain speech permission. The host can also manually adjust speech permissions in the player list. \n<Highlight> Host-Controlled Speech Order: </> In this mode, up to 8 microphone seats can be set. It defaults to sequential speech; only the host and the player on mic #1 can unmute. After the player on mic #1 finishes, they must click \"Step Down\" to pass the sequence to the player on mic #2.",
    ["<P_Heart>（我追溯过霍克斯男爵生前的场景，他在第二次敲门声响起时就已经倒下，又怎么可能回应仆人？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I traced the scene before Baron Hawkes' death; he had already collapsed when the second knock sounded, so how could he have responded to the servant?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（摇头）</>我可做不到。虽然嘴上总说她麻烦，但……她是我最好的朋友。"] = "<P_Heart> (Shaking head) </> I couldn't do it. Although I always say she's troublesome, but... she is my best friend.",
