    ["“大胆的尝试恰好遇上了克莱恩 后者成功解决了这起超凡案件……”"] = "\"The bold attempt happened to encounter Klein, and the latter successfully resolved this Extraordinary case……\"",
    ["“太阳”先生说，把学派当成家，那是什么？那群人嘴里念叨的故乡吗？"] = "Mr. Sun says to treat the Tarot Club as home, what is that? Is that the hometown that group of people keeps muttering about?",
    ["“愚者”先生，您介意多几次现在这样的“尝试”吗？"] = "Mr. \"Fool\", do you mind having a few more \"attempts\" like this?",
    ["　　我和几个学员从昨晚开始就在收拾东西，很快就能离开这诡异的地方了。\n　　可就在昨晚，又有两位研究员失踪了，还有几个人因为害怕而跑出了营地。我认为贸然跑出营地并不是理智的选择，因为野外的环境更加恶劣。\n　　我能看得出来曼斯教授也十分不安，但他是我们一行人的主心骨。他今天看起来是强撑着下达的指示，毕竟对于人类而言——未知是最古老最强烈的恐惧。"] = "　　I and a few students have been packing since last night, and we will soon be able to leave this eerie place.\n　　But just last night, two more researchers went missing, and several others ran out of the camp out of fear. I don't think running out of the camp rashly is a rational choice, because the environment in the wild is even harsher.\n　　I can tell that Professor Mans is also very uneasy, but he is the backbone of our group. He seemed to be forcing himself to give instructions today; after all, for humans—the unknown is the oldest and most intense horror.",
