    ["中央广场的观景拍照留念：\n位于廷根市中心的地标性广场，因此得名中央广场。\n广场连接着多条主干道，人们可以由此通往火车站、金梧桐大道、大学城等重要地点。\n川流不息的马车，会将廷根的未来带向更远的地方。"] = "Central Plaza Sightseeing Photo: \nA landmark plaza located in the center of Tingen, hence the name Central Plaza. \nThe plaza connects multiple main roads, allowing people to reach important locations such as the Train Station, Golden Indus Avenue, and the University District. \nThe endless stream of carriages will carry Tingen's future to even further places.",
